---
permalink: /logo/
noindex: true
groups:
  - id: peru-usa
    title: Peru + USA concepts
    items:
      - [Paired flags, concept-paired-flags.png, "Peru’s vertical bands and the United States’ stars and stripes meet in one banner."]
      - [Andes and Liberty, concept-andes-liberty.png, "Andean peaks sit beside the Statue of Liberty."]
      - [Chakana and star, concept-peru-usa-lockup.png, "An Andean stepped cross pairs with an American star and stripes above a two-color wordmark."]
  - id: redraws
    title: Polished redraws
    items:
      - [Flag heart, logo-1-clean.png, "A red, white, and navy heart with seven stars in three rows."]
      - [Gold flag heart, logo-1-gold.png, "Gold PERUSA lettering and seven white stars inside the navy lower third."]
      - [Circular badge, logo-2-clean.png, "Open navy rings, outlined lettering, and seven stars."]
  - id: emblems
    title: Crests and seals
    items:
      - [Andes crest, concept-andes-crest.png, "A mountain ridgeline and three stars inside a shield."]
      - [Seven-star seal, concept-seven-star-seal.png, "A retro round badge with a flag heart and an arc of stars."]
  - id: hearts
    title: Heart marks
    items:
      - [Ribbon heart, concept-ribbon-heart.png, "Interlocking ribbons and a star beside a horizontal wordmark."]
      - [Woven heart, concept-woven-heart.png, "Stepped bands inspired by Andean weaving."]
  - id: typography
    title: Wordmarks and monograms
    items:
      - [Star monogram, concept-star-monogram.png, "A compact P with a star cut into the letter."]
      - [Split wordmark, concept-split-wordmark.png, "Red PER and navy USA share one baseline."]
  - id: sketches
    title: Original sketches
    items:
      - [Heart sketch, logo-1.jpg, "Hand-painted flag heart with seven hand-drawn stars."]
      - [Badge sketch, logo-2.jpg, "Blue-ink circular badge on ruled paper."]
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title>PERUSA Logo Review</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/logo-review.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <header>
      <h1>PERUSA Logo Review</h1>
      <p>PERUSA brings together Peru and the United States. Compare the original sketches, polished redraws, and new concepts. Select any image to open it at full size.</p>
      <nav aria-label="Logo categories">
        {% for group in groups %}
          <a href="#{{ group.id }}">{{ group.title }}</a>
        {% endfor %}
      </nav>
    </header>

    {% for group in groups %}
      <section id="{{ group.id }}" aria-labelledby="{{ group.id }}-heading">
        <h2 id="{{ group.id }}-heading">{{ group.title }}</h2>
        <div class="gallery">
          {% for title, file, description in group.items %}
            <figure>
              <a class="preview" href="/logo/files/{{ file }}" aria-label="Open {{ title }} at full size">
                <img src="/logo/files/{{ file }}" alt="{{ description }}" {% if group.id != "peru-usa" %}loading="lazy"{% endif %}>
              </a>
              <figcaption>
                <h3>{{ title }}</h3>
                <p>{{ description }}</p>
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </main>
</body>
</html>
